---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Terms of Use | Janata Pratisthan" description="Terms for using the Janata Pratisthan website and its community information.">
  <main id="main-content" class="section">
    <article class="container article">
      <header class="article-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">Using this website</span>
        <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
        <p class="muted">Last updated: 27 October 2026 · Review and confirm these terms before launch.</p>
      </header>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>This page is a starter template, not legal advice. Have it reviewed and adapted to the organisation's legal status and actual activities before relying on it.</p>
        <h2>Website information</h2>
        <p>Website content is provided for general information about Janata Pratisthan and its community initiatives. Programme details, dates, eligibility, partners, and availability may change and should be confirmed through official channels.</p>
        <h2>Donations and tax claims</h2>
        <p>Do not transfer donations using unverified account details. Any registration number, tax exemption, or 80G claim must be published only after the organisation has confirmed the relevant documents and current approval status.</p>
        <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
        <p>Visitors must not misuse the website, attempt to disrupt its operation, submit unlawful content, or use information from the website in a misleading way.</p>
        <h2>Third-party services</h2>
        <p>Links to external services may be provided for convenience. Their content, privacy practices, and availability are managed by those providers.</p>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>For questions about these terms, contact Janata Pratisthan using the verified official contact details published on this website.</p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</Base>
